      "sourceTextSha256": "b0e3928fdc874a26a976f5a7a7c1edbcd3a9d7cd0436b182dc0d32381e91ebdb",
      "text": "Day 6 · Breakfast and tourist bus to Puno, with stops at Andahuaylillas, whose church is compared to the Sistine Chapel; Raqchi and its Inca temple; lunch in Sicuani; the colourful La Raya pass, with its market against a backdrop of mountains; and Pucará. Arrival in Puno in the evening, after about ten hours on the road, and transfer to the hotel. Optional: the PeruRail Titicaca train instead of the bus (see Optional excursions).",
